      "lines": [
        "7. 已知三边作三角形"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题. 用直尺和圆规作 $\\triangle XOY$，使 $|XO|=3.5$ 厘米，",
        "$|OY|=4$ 厘米，$|YX|=3$ 厘米."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 24",
      "box": [
        193,
        532,
        325,
        254
      ],
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
